#: ../../source/docs/ac_throttlemid.rst:5 9f8f9874eb524e21b9f3cd3cdf818347
msgid "Setting Hover Throttle"
msgstr "设置悬停油门"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_throttlemid.rst:7 e4ed771a522f45d0a2366b1b73fdf8a0
msgid ""
"Copter includes automatic learning of Hover Throttle (previously known as "
"\"mid throttle\") The :ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER <MOT_THST_HOVER>` value will "
"slowly move towards the average motor output whenever the vehicle is holding"
" a steady hover in non-manual flight modes (i.e. all modes except Stabilize "
"and Acro)."
msgstr ""
"Copter 包含悬停油门的自动学习功能（以前称为\"中位油门\"）。:ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER <MOT_THST_HOVER>` "
"值在飞行器以非手动飞行模式（即除 Stabilize 和 Acro 以外的所有模式）稳定悬停时，会缓慢向平均电机输出值靠拢。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_throttlemid.rst:10 2c88ba4948054ae79ed9c1b11a2f39ac
msgid ""
"If you wish to manually set the :ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER <MOT_THST_HOVER>` "
"value, it is best to download a dataflash log and set the value to what is "
"seen in the CTUN.ThO field. The value is usually between 0.2 and 0.6, but "
"may be lower if the copter has a very high power-to-weight ratio."
msgstr ""
"若希望手动设置 :ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER <MOT_THST_HOVER>` 值，最好下载 dataflash 日志，并将其设置为 "
"CTUN.ThO 字段中的值。该值通常在 0.2 至 0.6 之间，但若飞机功重比非常高则可能更低。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac_throttlemid.rst:12 e61b8f63abe04d5cb4cda5197b538b00
msgid ""
"If for some reason you wish to disable learning, you can set the "
":ref:`MOT_HOVER_LEARN <MOT_HOVER_LEARN>` parameter to 0."
msgstr "若出于某种原因希望禁用自动学习，可将 :ref:`MOT_HOVER_LEARN <MOT_HOVER_LEARN>` 参数设为 0。"
